<title>USA: Harris &amp; Harris names president, CFO.</title>
<headline>Harris &amp; Harris names president, CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris &amp; Harris Group Inc said on Monday it named Mel Melsheimer president, chief operating officer and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The titles of president and CFO had been held by Charles Harris, who will remain chairman and chief executive officer. The post of COO had been vacant, the company said.</p>
<p>For more than two years, Melsheimer was a consultant to the company, Harris said.</p>
